            <div xml:id="d92-a1">

                <pb facs="0210" n="94" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg94"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1—Summary.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>Report, dated July 10, of the Dean to the Diplomatic Body that he had made a
                    verbal demand upon the Wai Chiao Fu for interest on settled claims at 5% from
                    January 1, 1913; and that the Minister for Foreign Affairs had refused to
                    consider this request. Request of the Dean for the Diplomatic Body’s
                    authorization to convey formally its decision that interest should be so
                    paid.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
